WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:03.844
Hello everyone, welcome back to Nagarjuna.

00:00:03.844 --> 00:00:07.170
This is the tenth lesson of the venerated Nagarjuna.

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:11.522
We will be discussing
BCINGS PA DANG THAR PA BRTAG PA

00:00:11.522 --> 00:00:13.575
BCINGS PA DANG THAR PA BRTAG PA.

00:00:13.575 --> 00:00:16.742
Repeat after us: BCINGS PA, DANG

00:00:16.742 --> 00:00:19.180
THAR PA, BRTAG PA.

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:20.833
What is BRTAG PA? In

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:24.042
Sanskrit, it is

00:00:25.171 --> 00:00:28.020
PARĪKṢĀ (PARIKSHA).

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:32.690
An investigation into BCINGS PA and THAR PA:

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:37.620
BCINGS PA means bondage,
like being chained in a prison.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:39.350
THAR PA means freedom.

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:41.250
Now we will discuss the

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:46.250
emptiness of being bound in samsara,

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:49.960
and the emptiness of being free from those bondages.

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:52.990
Let's look at the first sentence, which is

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:55.383
actually only half a sentence. It begins with

00:00:56.874 --> 00:00:58.945
GAL TE. A

00:01:00.352 --> 00:01:03.342
fellow practitioner... Nagarjuna,

00:01:03.342 --> 00:01:06.584
is asking another person:

00:01:08.025 --> 00:01:10.650
"Who is in samsara?"

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:12.580
Who is in this cycle of samsara?

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:15.980
Who is going around in circles in samsara?

00:01:15.980 --> 00:01:18.500
This is an interesting question.

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:21.130
Incidentally, if you don't understand

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:24.405
who is going around in samsara,

00:01:24.405 --> 00:01:29.284
you will be going around in samsara yourself.

00:01:29.284 --> 00:01:31.030
So it's a pretty good question.

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:34.796
GAL TE
'DU BYED 'KHOR ZHE NA,

00:01:34.796 --> 00:01:38.030
DE DAG RTAG NA MI 'KHOR TE,

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:40.436
GAL TE means that

00:01:40.436 --> 00:01:42.620
Nagarjuna was talking to another person:

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:47.060
"Who is wandering in samsara?" The

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:48.670
other person said: 'DU BYED'.

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:52.610
This is a confusing answer
because 'DU BYED' means cause and effect. And

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:54.100
it is, for example,

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:55.850
the name of the second stage of the wheel of life, which

00:01:55.850 --> 00:01:58.390
is the initial karma.

00:01:58.390 --> 00:02:00.360
But that has nothing to do with the meaning here.

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:03.692
Here it refers to PHUNG PO,

00:02:03.692 --> 00:02:04.942
body and consciousness.

00:02:04.942 --> 00:02:06.440
Lately I like to call it body and consciousness

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:07.920
because it's easier to understand. It is

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:11.450
exactly what we call body and consciousness.

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:16.450
If you say that what is going around in samsara

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:21.260
is the combination of body and consciousness, both body and consciousness together

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:22.472
'KHOR ZHE NA',

00:02:22.472 --> 00:02:25.770


00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:29.000
then do you think of body and consciousness

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:32.840
as unchanging or changing?

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:35.150
When you're about to answer, when I ask you,

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:37.730
who travels through samsara,

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:40.070
who is reborn again and again,

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:42.380
and you answer body and consciousness,

00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:44.810
Michael's body and consciousness,

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:48.510
I say, "Is it something unchanging,

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:50.290
or something that changes?"

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:53.010
Nagarjuna usually gives both answers. The

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:56.700
other person says it's unchanging,

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:58.780
something that doesn't change. Oh,

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:01.912


00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:08.300
if Michael's body and consciousness are

00:03:09.730 --> 00:03:13.600
unchanging, by the way, that leads to eternity, right?

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:16.410
Some people mistranslate this word.

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:18.150
It leads to eternity.

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:22.280
If Michael's eternal body and consciousness are

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:25.410
constantly traveling in the cycle of reincarnation,

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:27.084


00:03:27.084 --> 00:03:29.334
then it cannot go in circles.

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:31.320
Why?

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:33.870
Because it is RTAG PA.
Because it is unchanging, to go around in

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:36.380
circles you must change. Through going around in

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:37.890
circles you will change. Going around in

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:40.770
circles means you will change.

00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:44.060
If you don't change, you can't go to other places.

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:47.460
At least you have to change where you sit.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.770
Some things have to change when you travel.

00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:53.070
Therefore, it can't be Michael.

00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:56.280
Michael's unchanging body and consciousness

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:58.600
because it has to be reborn again and again. Then

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:00.200
another person will come back and say:

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:01.420
"Okay, then I'll change my story. It's a

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:05.850
body and consciousness that change."

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:09.450
Here is the next sentence, yay~

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:13.170
By the way, the second half of this verse

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:15.410
has been split up again. The

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:17.860
first part of the second half is

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.893
MI RTAG NA YANG 'KHOR MI 'GYUR

00:04:20.893 --> 00:04:23.700
MI RTAG NA YANG 'KHOR MI 'GYUR

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:28.700
If you say that Michael's body and consciousness change,

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:33.580
then they can't go around in the cycle of reincarnation.

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:34.413
Why?

00:04:34.413 --> 00:04:38.840
Because they disappear every thousandth of a second,

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:41.415
understand?  They can maintain...

00:04:41.415 --> 00:04:42.990
SKAD CIG GIS SKAD CIG GIS... The

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:46.216
definition of change

00:04:46.216 --> 00:04:47.368
SKAD CIG GIS SKAD CIG GIS

00:04:47.368 --> 00:04:49.208
Repeat SKAD CIG GIS

00:04:50.437 --> 00:04:52.669
SKAD CIG GIS SKAD CIG GIS

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:59.910
This could be a good song
SKAD CIG GIS SKAD CIG GIS... It

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:02.210
means

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:03.826
things that appear and disappear

00:05:03.826 --> 00:05:07.184
SKAD CIG every moment

00:05:07.184 --> 00:05:09.975
SKAD CIG GIS SKAD CIG GIS

00:05:11.308 --> 00:05:15.266
How can it go on forever?

00:05:15.266 --> 00:05:18.530
If it disappears every thousandth of a second, how can

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:21.090
something that disappears every thousandth of a second go around

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:24.500
in circles?  It

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:25.970
's impossible.

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:27.380
Why?

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:32.380
Because every thousandth of a second,

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:37.230
Michael's body and consciousness are separate from the previous thousandth of a second

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:39.090
, right?

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:41.670
We have spent a long time

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:43.660
explaining SAṂSARGA (SANSARGA)

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:45.763
Christina, SANSARGA

00:05:45.763 --> 00:05:47.192
flows together.

00:05:47.192 --> 00:05:51.908
Yes, if Geshe-sensei's body and consciousness are like

00:05:51.908 --> 00:05:54.260
tap, tap, tap, tap,

00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:57.450
then each moment is separate.

00:05:57.450 --> 00:05:59.670
Then there is no reason why this

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:02.220
should go to that,
because they never touch.

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:05.850
So this can also become Tim's body and consciousness,

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:07.350
right?

00:06:07.350 --> 00:06:10.463
Since they are not connected anyway,

00:06:10.463 --> 00:06:13.863
if Michael's body and consciousness are like this,

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:19.390
why can't Michael's body and consciousness be like this,

00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:21.870
and then become Tim in the next moment?  Why not?  There's

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:24.200
no reason why I can't become Tim.

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:28.030
Tim and Geshe-sensei aren't connected either.

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:30.297
If there's no connection between Geshe-sensei and Geshe-sensei,

00:06:30.297 --> 00:06:33.383
but Geshe-sensei can move from one moment to the next like this,

00:06:33.383 --> 00:06:35.390
then Geshe-sensei's body and consciousness can also

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:37.290
become Tim's body and consciousness.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:41.107
Then I can go over there and join Tim's cycle of reincarnation,

00:06:41.107 --> 00:06:43.080
right?  Do you understand?

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:46.060
If they are separate, anything can happen,

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:48.290
but it cannot be connected.

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:50.260
It cannot be a continuous stream.

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:51.093
Why?

00:06:51.093 --> 00:06:52.720
Because it will remain unchanged,

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:55.370
then you will not have different births, and

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:57.770
you will always be stuck in the same moment,

00:06:57.770 --> 00:06:59.985
just like... what's the name of that movie?

00:06:59.985 --> 00:07:03.636
"Temporarily suspended today."
Yes, "Temporarily suspended today."

00:07:03.636 --> 00:07:06.403
Okay, next sentence.

00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:10.620
Where?

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:13.837
We should have a picture, right?

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:16.970
Let's talk about circles.

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:20.810
I think it should be seconds. Lama

00:07:20.810 --> 00:07:25.810
Qiuni said: If Geshe's body and consciousness

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:28.870
can only last for one-thousandth of a second,

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:31.950
how can there be time to circle?  You

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:34.850
can't form a circle with just one point.

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.820
You can't draw a circle

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:38.980
with just one point.

00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:41.403
Okay, next sentence:

00:07:44.693 --> 00:07:48.151
SEMS CAN LA YANG RIM 'DI MTSUNGS

00:07:48.151 --> 00:07:50.818
SEMS CAN LA YANG RIM 'DI MTSUNGS

00:07:51.923 --> 00:07:55.140
SEMS CAN means living beings.

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:56.560
You can also say sentient beings.

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:59.800
I don't like this word because it's not really English. You

00:07:59.800 --> 00:08:02.030
wouldn't usually say it like that in English.

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:06.090
How is your sentient being mother?

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:09.514
Anyway, it refers to biological

00:08:09.514 --> 00:08:13.949
SEMS CAN LA YANG, RIM
RIM. What does it mean?  Like Lam Rim

00:08:13.949 --> 00:08:15.090
(steps),

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:20.090
in Nagarjuna Rim, Rim has a special

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:24.763
meaning. It means the steps leading to the argument I just gave you.

00:08:25.610 --> 00:08:29.060
Those steps that lead to the final argument are

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:30.820
called Rim (steps) in Nagarjuna's words.

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:33.060
When you see Nagarjuna mention Rim, you

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:36.000
should think: the steps leading to my final argument.

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:38.310
What does that mean here?

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:43.080
If you say that what is circling in the wheel of life

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:45.570


00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:47.710
is not Geshe's body and consciousness,

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:52.710
but Geshe himself,

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:54.960
then that is RIM MTSUNGS, the same argument.

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:57.510
Returning to the same argument, what is that?

00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:00.160
What was the first question Nagarjuna asked?

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:03.860
Don't forget we've already discussed the body and consciousness.

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:07.250
Now that person says, "Okay, the body and consciousness can't go in circles, so it must

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:10.650
be Geshe-la that's going in circles."

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:13.550
Alright, let's do the same argument.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:15.470
We asked him two questions:

00:09:15.470 --> 00:09:19.330
If you say Geshe-la is going in circles in samsara,

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:23.840
then is the Geshe-la you're referring to unchanging?

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:26.440
He started by talking about what is unchanging, but I don't know why

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:28.690
you're talking about the unchanging Geshe teacher?  Yes, yes,

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:31.190
I'm talking about the unchanging Geshe teacher.

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:32.830
How could he possibly go in circles?

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:33.663
Because he's always at the same point.

00:09:33.663 --> 00:09:35.690
He's the same person.

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:38.940
He won't become an animal, a celestial being, or a being from hell.

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:40.570
He will always be the Geshe teacher.

00:09:40.570 --> 00:09:43.360
He can't change.

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:45.387
So what is the second RIM PA?

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:49.110
Or are you saying that Geshe-la (Geshe teacher) is subject to

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:50.100
change?

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:53.920
So he is the various random moments of Geshe-la-shi. In that

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:55.640
case,

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:58.380
we have already proved with the contact argument

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:02.690
 
that there is not necessarily a connection between Geshe-la-shi's first moment

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:05.100
and Geshe-la-shi's second moment.

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:08.330
Geshe-la-shi's first moment can become Tim's second moment.

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:10.260
So who is going around in circles?

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:14.011
Therefore, no one is in the cycle of reincarnation,

00:10:14.011 --> 00:10:16.740
no one travels through the wheel of life.

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:17.573
Why?

00:10:17.573 --> 00:10:19.400
Because it is neither Geshe-la-shi's body and consciousness

00:10:19.400 --> 00:10:21.010
nor Geshe-la-shi, why?

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.390
Because it's neither a Geshe teacher with a

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:23.570
body and consciousness that can change and remain unchanged, nor a

00:10:23.570 --> 00:10:24.953
Geshe teacher who can change and remain unchanged,

00:10:24.953 --> 00:10:29.810
then there's nothing else. There's
no one going around in circles in reincarnation.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:32.380
Okay, we have a picture.

00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:36.697
By the way, there's a concept that Lama Chuni likes to talk about...

00:10:36.697 --> 00:10:40.340
He said, don't forget, when we mention Geshe teachers,

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:42.980
relative to the body and consciousness of a Geshe teacher, we're

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:47.270
talking about something like a soul. Is

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:50.810
there a huge Geshe teacher who

00:10:50.810 --> 00:10:53.690
keeps reincarnating again and again?

00:10:53.690 --> 00:10:55.430
He doesn't look like a Geshe teacher; he

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:58.417
's unrelated to body and consciousness.

00:10:58.417 --> 00:11:03.417
There's some kind of inner soul or essence of a Geshe teacher who

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:07.040
acquires different bodies and consciousnesses, right?

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:09.750
He will discard the old body and consciousness

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:11.000
and acquire a new body and consciousness.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:12.100
Therefore, there is a Geshe teacher who is unrelated to the Geshe teacher's body and consciousness. The

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:14.570


00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:19.210
Geshe teacher has this third part, which

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:22.500
is the "super inner Geshe teacher".

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:26.320
And the inner Geshe teacher will continuously change the body and consciousness.

00:11:26.320 --> 00:11:29.338
This is the second argument, which

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:32.555
I will talk about. In fact,

00:11:32.555 --> 00:11:34.180
that is what the whole chapter is about. Do

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:36.920
n't cheat yet, let's continue. That

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:38.730
is actually the focus of the whole chapter.

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:39.670
Good question.

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:41.986
Let's continue. The next

00:11:43.661 --> 00:11:45.452
sentence is

00:11:49.117 --> 00:11:50.858
GAL TE GANG ZAG 'KHOR ZHE NA,

00:11:50.858 --> 00:11:53.299
PHUNG PO SKYE MCHED KHAMS RNAMS LA,

00:11:53.299 --> 00:11:56.140
DE NI RNAM PA LNGAS BTZAL NA,

00:11:56.140 --> 00:11:59.600
MED NA GANG ZHIG 'KHOR BAR 'GYUR.

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:02.770
This part has two sentences, and this is the first sentence.

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:04.640
GAL TE GANG ZAG 'KHOR ZHE NA.

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:05.960
That person insists,

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:08.230
no, that is the Geshe teacher.

00:12:08.230 --> 00:12:11.496
That GANG ZAG, PURUSHA

00:12:11.496 --> 00:12:14.680
is the Geshe teacher going from one life to the next.

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:19.680
He abandons his old body and consciousness, and acquires a new one,

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:21.990
much like some high school boys treat their girlfriends

00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:24.850
or some high school girls treat their boyfriends.

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:27.200
He abandons one body and consciousness and takes another, and

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:28.610
then another,

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:31.550
but he continues to attend high school.

00:12:31.550 --> 00:12:36.550
That person said that it was indeed Geshe-la as he was

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:40.640
constantly being reborn.

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:44.300
So let's examine the

00:12:44.300 --> 00:12:45.850
relationship between Geshe-la and his body and consciousness.

00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:50.850
If it really is Geshe-la

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:54.660
constantly abandoning his body and consciousness

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:56.390
and acquiring a new one,

00:12:56.390 --> 00:12:57.810
then

00:12:57.810 --> 00:13:00.790
what is the relationship between Geshe-la and his body and consciousness?

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:02.470
Because of certain relationships between him and his body and consciousness,

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:04.550
he cannot

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:07.980
change his body and consciousness.

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:10.560
If Geshe-sensei is his body and consciousness,

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:12.590
then he cannot abandon his body and consciousness to be

00:13:12.590 --> 00:13:15.263
reborn into the next life
because he would disappear.

00:13:16.530 --> 00:13:20.330
If Geshe-sensei is his body and consciousness,

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:23.090
once he abandons his body and consciousness to obtain the next body and consciousness,

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:25.510
Geshe-sensei can no longer be the same body and consciousness as before.

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:28.170
He must be some kind of

00:13:28.170 --> 00:13:29.580
superhuman who can change his body and consciousness, right?

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:33.590
So what exactly is their relationship?
Nagarjuna said: Okay, okay.

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:34.670
Geshe-sensei will continue, right?

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:35.837
Is it true that

00:13:35.837 --> 00:13:37.380
Geshe-la can change bodies and consciousness?

00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:38.213
So,

00:13:38.213 --> 00:13:40.780
Geshe-laoshi (the teacher) couldn't possibly be his body and consciousness,
right?

00:13:40.780 --> 00:13:41.613
Why?

00:13:41.613 --> 00:13:44.010
Because he will abandon his body and consciousness and go somewhere else.

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:46.643
If he is his body and consciousness and he abandons his body and consciousness,

00:13:46.643 --> 00:13:49.016
he will disappear. Do you

00:13:49.016 --> 00:13:49.849
understand?

00:13:49.849 --> 00:13:51.787
There is no Geshe teacher who can change the body and consciousness,

00:13:51.787 --> 00:13:53.740
because he is his own body and consciousness.

00:13:53.740 --> 00:13:56.280
We should look at the

00:13:56.280 --> 00:13:59.240
relationship between the Geshe teacher and his body and consciousness.

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:01.800
Then he said RNAM PA LNGAS BCOL.

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:05.170
All the texts have RNAM PA LNGAS BCOL, which is

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:08.363
completely misspelled.

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:11.707
I should correct it.

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:14.639
Tim, if you can imagine the

00:14:14.639 --> 00:14:17.836
letters CA - ཅ, the first column, and

00:14:17.836 --> 00:14:22.419
above it is naro, then it is CO - ཅོ, right?

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:26.010
But if you draw a naro with a single

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:28.260
horn—by the way, naro means horn—

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:29.720
what would it become?  The

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:33.180
CA with a small flag next to it

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:35.510
becomes TZA - ཙ, right?

00:14:35.510 --> 00:14:37.960
All the texts write BCOL - བཅོལ,

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:41.020
they're all wrong, it should be BTZAL - བཙལ.

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.810
This is the first problem.

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:44.586
You might spend two days

00:14:44.586 --> 00:14:45.660
looking up the word BCOLs in the dictionary and

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:47.210
you'll never find it.

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:50.090
And all the engravings are wrong.

00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:53.578
This makes someone very unhappy.

00:14:53.578 --> 00:14:57.220
DE NI RNAM PA LNGAS
BTZAL NA. If you...

00:14:58.469 --> 00:15:00.905
BTZAL means something like PHYAG 'TSAL.

00:15:00.905 --> 00:15:02.478
What is 'TSAL' in PHYAG 'TSAL?

00:15:03.503 --> 00:15:06.400
But what does it really mean?

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:09.491
Seeking grace from the Guru.

00:15:09.491 --> 00:15:11.710
BTZAL means seeking, searching.

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:13.897
So here it means searching.

00:15:13.897 --> 00:15:16.150
RNAM PA LNGA five different ways. There are five possible relationships

00:15:16.150 --> 00:15:20.060
between Michael and Michael's body and consciousness.

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:23.010


00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:24.610
Let's look at these five relationships.

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:28.100
If you say that Michael is constantly being reborn,

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:30.690
constantly changing his body and consciousness,

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:33.970
then let's look at what possible relationships exist between Michael and his body and consciousness.

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:35.840


00:15:35.840 --> 00:15:38.730
But Nagarjuna won't...

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:42.810
tell you which five.

00:15:42.810 --> 00:15:45.680
He never mentions which five. He

00:15:45.680 --> 00:15:47.160
never tells you which five relationships.

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:49.000
This is where Geshe-laoshi is reading late into the night:

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:52.790
My God, where exactly are the five relationships written?

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:55.237
If you were a Geshe teacher and encountered this situation late at night,

00:15:55.237 --> 00:15:57.568
and you had to teach the next morning, what would you do?

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:00.750
You would search for Gofer, search the database.

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:02.740
I searched the database and the

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:08.740
first answer I got was Rendawa.

00:16:09.920 --> 00:16:11.650
We call him Jezun Rendawa. Do

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:13.670
you know who Jezun Rendawa is?

00:16:13.670 --> 00:16:17.730
He was a Sakya master, Tsongkhapa's teacher,

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:20.410
one of Tsongkhapa's main teachers.

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:23.240
They started as teacher and student,

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:26.210
but later collaborated to form a teaching team.

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:28.090
They would teach the Vinaya together,

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:29.230
and so on.

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:31.700
Incidentally, Rendawa

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:35.653
wrote a very brilliant commentary on the Letter to a Friend—

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:41.473
brief, sweet, and precise.

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:45.840
He also

00:16:45.840 --> 00:16:49.940
wrote a commentary on Nagarjuna's Treatise on Wisdom, also brief and

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:51.940
precise.

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:55.150
So I started by looking there. After

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:57.640
looking at his work for a while,

00:16:57.640 --> 00:17:00.877
I went to look at Tsongkhapa's commentary on

00:17:00.877 --> 00:17:04.313
Nagarjuna's Treatise on Wisdom, called...

00:17:06.778 --> 00:17:08.428
yes, "The Ocean of Reasoning."

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:12.230
That's the ship we're on.

00:17:12.230 --> 00:17:14.920
We're trying to cross the sea.

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:19.420
So, combining all of them, I got some good answers.

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:23.040
That's the beauty of this text.

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:27.800
Everyone has tried to interpret it,

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:29.710
and it's difficult, really difficult.

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:33.420
Therefore, there are hundreds of commentaries on this text.

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:38.910
Chandrakirti also tried to interpret it, right?  Let's

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:41.080
look at the

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:44.830
following five possible relationships

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:48.490
between Michael and Michael's body and consciousness.

00:17:48.490 --> 00:17:52.570
Here are the five relationships between them.
What is my final conclusion?

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:57.570
Oh, to be fair to Nagarjuna,
he already gave five relationships in the text,

00:17:58.700 --> 00:18:01.799
but we've forgotten that

00:18:01.799 --> 00:18:03.420
he gave them a long time ago

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:05.530
when he was talking about the relationship between certain things and certain things.

00:18:05.530 --> 00:18:07.418


00:18:07.418 --> 00:18:08.990
What was it again?  He had already discussed the relationship

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:11.210
between fire and firewood

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:13.990
back then,

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:17.250
which is why he wasn't lazy.

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:21.260
When he mentioned the five possible relationships,

00:18:21.260 --> 00:18:23.060
he had already said it. He had already said it

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:25.160
when he talked about the relationship between fire and firewood,

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:26.870


00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:30.150
so he probably sat there impatiently and

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:32.610
said, "Idiot, stop asking me!

00:18:32.610 --> 00:18:37.250
Go back to Chapter 10, sentence 14!"
I checked, and it said,

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:38.940
"I already said it back then,

00:18:38.940 --> 00:18:41.260
so don't say I didn't tell you which five relationships.

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:44.720
I expected you to remember."

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:47.583
These are the following five.

00:18:47.583 --> 00:18:51.390
You might have quickly skimmed through them and

00:18:51.390 --> 00:18:53.150
then stopped thinking about them,

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:55.499
but let's think about it carefully. Let's

00:18:57.649 --> 00:19:02.007
start with Tim.
Is Tim his body and consciousness?

00:19:04.308 --> 00:19:06.400
In this discussion, let's

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:10.200
not forget that the topic is

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:12.020
how Tim is reincarnated life after life in the cycle of life.

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:13.990


00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:17.365
The question is quite simple:

00:19:17.365 --> 00:19:18.198
Is Tim...? Is

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:22.390
Tim's current body and consciousness

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:24.728
all that he is?

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:29.120
No, because if it dies, Tim disappears

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:30.760
and no one continues the cycle of reincarnation.

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:35.760
Therefore, Tim cannot be equal to Tim's body and consciousness,

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:38.760
because someone must acquire the body and consciousness,

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:41.270
and someone must also abandon that body and consciousness.

00:19:41.270 --> 00:19:43.575
Now, continuing with Patch, the second question is

00:19:44.470 --> 00:19:49.470
whether Patch is completely separated from his body and consciousness.

00:19:55.030 --> 00:19:58.305
Look, his body and consciousness just collapsed immediately.

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:01.520
No, they must have some connection. They

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:03.160
must have some connection, right?

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:05.960
Otherwise, you would be Tim.

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:08.500
Otherwise, Patch would become Tim.

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:11.620
He would grab the body and consciousness closest to him.

00:20:13.780 --> 00:20:16.543
Therefore, there must be a Patch who is

00:20:18.060 --> 00:20:19.934
not separate from his body and consciousness. There

00:20:19.934 --> 00:20:21.284
must be a Patch who

00:20:21.284 --> 00:20:23.700
is connected to his body and consciousness in some way.

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:25.400
You can say that there is a Patch who is

00:20:25.400 --> 00:20:28.270
separate from his body and consciousness,
but he must also be

00:20:28.270 --> 00:20:31.172
entangled with his body and consciousness to some extent.

00:20:31.172 --> 00:20:33.046
Otherwise, he would be entangled with Rebecca's body and consciousness.

00:20:33.046 --> 00:20:34.184


00:20:34.184 --> 00:20:35.383
Then you would have difficulty even combing your hair,

00:20:35.383 --> 00:20:37.630


00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:40.083
and you would have a beard, etc...

00:20:40.083 --> 00:20:43.335
All sorts of philosophical problems would arise.

00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:49.280
Okay, so Tim is not his body and consciousness,

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:52.390
but Patch is not completely separate from his body and consciousness. There is a

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:53.820
certain degree of connection.

00:20:53.820 --> 00:20:55.826
Okay, the third possibility:

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:03.230
Does Rebecca's body and consciousness contain Rebecca to some extent?

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:09.450
Let's look at it from the opposite perspective.

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:13.190
So we're no longer looking at whether Rebecca has a body and consciousness,

00:21:13.190 --> 00:21:15.215
but rather whether that body and consciousness on the other side

00:21:15.215 --> 00:21:18.465
reached out and grabbed Rebecca.

00:21:20.490 --> 00:21:22.081
This idea is strange,

00:21:22.081 --> 00:21:24.740
but it's the third of five possibilities.

00:21:24.740 --> 00:21:28.740
To some extent, it's your body and consciousness that drew you in. It's the

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:33.560
gravity of your body and consciousness that pulled Rebecca in.

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:36.250
So Rebecca got stuck in Rebecca's body and consciousness.

00:21:36.250 --> 00:21:39.040
That's the third possibility. It's a bit silly,

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:41.093
but not entirely.

00:21:44.036 --> 00:21:46.203
Fourth possibility, is Pao ready?

00:21:47.460 --> 00:21:51.630
Pao doesn't depend on her body and consciousness.

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:54.100
You can do anything to her body and consciousness

00:21:54.100 --> 00:21:56.803
without affecting Pao.

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:00.680
You can get infected with the virus and get vaccinated,

00:22:00.680 --> 00:22:02.533
but Pao doesn't care. Pao

00:22:03.446 --> 00:22:06.460
is an individual separate from her body and consciousness.

00:22:06.460 --> 00:22:10.090
Pao is not situated above her body and consciousness.

00:22:10.090 --> 00:22:11.977
This is the fourth possibility, right?

00:22:11.977 --> 00:22:12.977
We have four, right?

00:22:12.977 --> 00:22:16.293
1, 2, 3, 4
Christina, are you ready?

00:22:18.680 --> 00:22:22.203
Christina's body and consciousness do not depend on Christina,

00:22:23.100 --> 00:22:25.860
so Christina can run away.

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:28.523
But Christina's body and consciousness are still typing in the chair,

00:22:30.350 --> 00:22:33.080
which is the fifth possibility.

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:38.080
And all five possibilities are a bit untenable.

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:40.800
They are all a bit unlikely. They

00:22:40.800 --> 00:22:43.130
sound impossible. What do you think of when

00:22:43.130 --> 00:22:46.350
you think about traveling through reincarnation

00:22:46.350 --> 00:22:48.492
?  What do

00:22:48.492 --> 00:22:51.100
you think is the relationship between you, your body, and your consciousness

00:22:51.100 --> 00:22:52.240
?

00:22:52.240 --> 00:22:53.885
Can you discard your body and consciousness,

00:22:53.885 --> 00:22:56.460
yet still retain something that can continue

00:22:56.460 --> 00:22:57.720
and be transferred to a new body and consciousness?

00:22:57.720 --> 00:23:00.610
Can you exist without a body and consciousness?

00:23:00.610 --> 00:23:03.730
Can you exist without your body and consciousness?

00:23:03.730 --> 00:23:05.430
Can it continue without you?

00:23:05.430 --> 00:23:09.450
When you're contemplating the

00:23:09.450 --> 00:23:10.720
cycle of life and reincarnation,

00:23:10.720 --> 00:23:15.185
you haven't truly grasped the concept.

00:23:15.185 --> 00:23:17.000
This is what Nagarjuna is trying to say.

00:23:17.000 --> 00:23:19.100
Perhaps you have some concept of it, but

00:23:19.100 --> 00:23:20.410
I think most people feel...

00:23:20.410 --> 00:23:22.180
at least I grew up in a Christian culture, a

00:23:22.180 --> 00:23:24.330
Judeo-Christian culture.

00:23:24.330 --> 00:23:27.280
I feel that some Michael's soul

00:23:27.280 --> 00:23:29.940
acquired a body and consciousness and held it for a while.

00:23:29.940 --> 00:23:33.190
Then they separated, and the soul continued. Then the

00:23:33.190 --> 00:23:35.404
soul had to find a new body and consciousness,

00:23:35.404 --> 00:23:38.136
or something like that. In this way,

00:23:39.090 --> 00:23:41.740
you can do anything to the body and consciousness;

00:23:41.740 --> 00:23:43.580
you can abuse the body and consciousness,

00:23:43.580 --> 00:23:46.120
but the soul transcends all of that. The

00:23:46.120 --> 00:23:49.620
soul has no effect whatsoever, and so on.

00:23:49.620 --> 00:23:53.010
Judeo-Christian culture

00:23:53.010 --> 00:23:56.220
has its objections to this issue

00:23:56.220 --> 00:23:59.230
because we grew up in that culture,
so we have this feeling.

00:23:59.230 --> 00:24:02.348
But if you really examine it, is it justifiable?

00:24:02.348 --> 00:24:04.173
Is this reasonable?

00:24:05.330 --> 00:24:10.030
Are you completely independent of your body and consciousness?

00:24:10.030 --> 00:24:12.928
Is there a Rebecca who

00:24:14.010 --> 00:24:16.820
is completely unaffected by the body and consciousness?

00:24:19.337 --> 00:24:22.210
If you're interested, you can go back and look at

00:24:22.210 --> 00:24:25.060
sentence 14 of chapter 10.

00:24:25.060 --> 00:24:29.560
They're discussing whether firewood is fire.

00:24:29.560 --> 00:24:31.440
That's the same argument, which is

00:24:31.440 --> 00:24:33.390
why Nagarjuna doesn't repeat it.

00:24:38.967 --> 00:24:43.560
GAL TE MANG POS BKUR BA.
Sorry, no, that's all.

00:24:43.560 --> 00:24:45.110


00:24:46.801 --> 00:24:47.634
Okay,

00:24:49.410 --> 00:24:50.870
let's go to...

00:24:53.860 --> 00:24:54.693
'DU BYED.

00:24:57.260 --> 00:25:01.394
Didn't we talk about the third sentence, NYE BAR LEN
?

00:25:02.230 --> 00:25:04.910
Oh, you're right, Part Two.

00:25:04.910 --> 00:25:06.531
Oh yes, this is tricky. I

00:25:07.800 --> 00:25:10.950
don't know why I skipped it. Let's

00:25:11.850 --> 00:25:14.963
go back.
We know what you're talking about.

00:25:17.600 --> 00:25:20.442
NYE BAR LEN NAS NYER LEN PAR,

00:25:20.442 --> 00:25:22.550
'KHOR NA SRID PA MED PAR 'GYUR,

00:25:22.550 --> 00:25:24.332
SRID MED NYE BAR LEN MED NA,

00:25:24.332 --> 00:25:27.680
DE GANG CI ZHIG 'KHOR BAR 'GYUR,

00:25:27.680 --> 00:25:30.030
This is tricky because NYE BAR LEN PA

00:25:30.030 --> 00:25:33.870
is a very difficult term in Buddhist philosophy. It

00:25:33.870 --> 00:25:38.082
means to closely take on

00:25:38.082 --> 00:25:39.380
NYE BAR LEN PA,

00:25:39.380 --> 00:25:44.207
but here it means to
acquire a new body and consciousness at the time of rebirth.

00:25:44.207 --> 00:25:48.688
Even if this term implies something?

00:25:51.170 --> 00:25:53.070
Yes, someone obtained it.

00:25:53.070 --> 00:25:56.730
So, according to ancient Buddhism,

00:25:56.730 --> 00:26:01.657
rebirth is called embracing another, meaning

00:26:04.140 --> 00:26:06.310


00:26:06.310 --> 00:26:10.650
another body and consciousness.

00:26:10.650 --> 00:26:15.420
Therefore, Nagarjuna used it in the word rebirth.

00:26:15.420 --> 00:26:17.270
He used this word to represent rebirth.

00:26:17.270 --> 00:26:21.900
He said, "Is rebirth...?"

00:26:21.900 --> 00:26:23.720
What happens between each rebirth?

00:26:23.720 --> 00:26:26.160
Let's look at it, and then we can decide what the relationship is

00:26:26.160 --> 00:26:30.060
between you and your body and consciousness.

00:26:30.060 --> 00:26:33.850


00:26:33.850 --> 00:26:36.820
Let's see how you go from one rebirth
to the next.

00:26:36.820 --> 00:26:38.770
Then we can decide

00:26:38.770 --> 00:26:42.083
what the relationship is between Tim and Tim's body and consciousness.

00:26:43.030 --> 00:26:46.190
Here he says NYE ​​BAR
LEN NAS NYER LEN PAR.

00:26:46.190 --> 00:26:49.220
For example, when you change from one identity to another, and

00:26:49.220 --> 00:26:52.850
then the Khuni Lama says...
I don't understand why he says that.

00:26:52.850 --> 00:26:57.010
"If you are reborn from a human to a celestial being,"

00:26:57.010 --> 00:27:01.373
reborn into a sacred and temporary suffering being,

00:27:02.780 --> 00:27:05.390
this is somewhat implying that we are doing meditation

00:27:05.390 --> 00:27:09.530
'KHOR NA SRID PA MED PAR 'GYUR,'

00:27:09.530 --> 00:27:12.351
then there is no SRID PA in 'KHOR BA. '

00:27:12.351 --> 00:27:15.604
KHOR BA' is reincarnation.

00:27:15.604 --> 00:27:19.440
SRID PA here means...
Here you need the Khuni Lama again.

00:27:19.440 --> 00:27:21.310
It doesn't refer to SRID PA, which

00:27:21.310 --> 00:27:25.435
originally means reincarnation,
like SRID PA'I 'KHOR LO

00:27:25.435 --> 00:27:30.010
BHAVACAKRA, the wheel of life.
Here it doesn't mean that. Here it

00:27:30.010 --> 00:27:32.070
means BAR SRID.

00:27:32.070 --> 00:27:33.987
Since you have read the Abhidharma,

00:27:33.987 --> 00:27:38.987
you will know what BAR SRID
BAR DO is.  SRID PA

00:27:40.490 --> 00:27:44.300
Yes, beings in the intermediate state are called BAR SRID, or bar people. Bar

00:27:44.300 --> 00:27:47.166
people,

00:27:47.166 --> 00:27:48.390


00:27:48.390 --> 00:27:51.496
not the kind of bar people (people in bars).

00:27:51.496 --> 00:27:53.045
BAR SRID

00:27:53.045 --> 00:27:56.210
KHOR NA SRID PA MED PAR 'GYUR

00:27:56.210 --> 00:28:00.457
If you abandon... how should I put it?

00:28:02.190 --> 00:28:04.960
If you abandon one body and consciousness,

00:28:04.960 --> 00:28:08.400
and then in the next moment acquire another body and consciousness,

00:28:08.400 --> 00:28:10.042
then there is no intermediate state.

00:28:10.880 --> 00:28:12.115
This is what he wanted to say.

00:28:12.115 --> 00:28:14.630
Nagarjuna said, "How do you go

00:28:14.630 --> 00:28:17.080
from one rebirth to the next?"

00:28:17.080 --> 00:28:18.270
Another person said,

00:28:18.270 --> 00:28:19.637
"Oh, you just abandon one body and consciousness,

00:28:19.637 --> 00:28:23.080
and then in a fraction of a second you acquire a new one."

00:28:23.080 --> 00:28:25.008
Okay, then there is no intermediate state.

00:28:25.008 --> 00:28:27.530
That violates Buddhist teachings. There should be an

00:28:27.530 --> 00:28:29.070
intermediate state. It should

00:28:29.070 --> 00:28:34.070
exist; most rebirths have one.

00:28:34.130 --> 00:28:37.007
Then that person said no, no, no.

00:28:37.007 --> 00:28:39.540
SRID MED NYE BAR LEN MED NA,

00:28:42.806 --> 00:28:44.122
SRID MED NYE BAR LEN MED NA,

00:28:44.122 --> 00:28:47.800
DE GANG CI ZHIG 'KHOR BAR 'GYUR,

00:28:47.800 --> 00:28:52.670
if there is an interruption between each rebirth...

00:28:52.670 --> 00:28:55.751
How can you say there is a cycle of reincarnation?

00:28:56.720 --> 00:29:01.720
If it is interrupted,

00:29:02.160 --> 00:29:05.630
how can you say there is a continuous cycle of rebirth?

00:29:05.630 --> 00:29:07.840
If you say no, no, no, there is an intermediate state (bardo),

00:29:07.840 --> 00:29:10.090
then there might not be a connection between abandoning this body and consciousness

00:29:10.090 --> 00:29:12.480
and acquiring your next body and consciousness,

00:29:12.480 --> 00:29:15.100


00:29:15.100 --> 00:29:17.690
because there's a gap between the two.

00:29:17.690 --> 00:29:20.650
If there's a gap, it's not a cycle; a

00:29:20.650 --> 00:29:22.120
cycle can't be formed. A cycle

00:29:22.120 --> 00:29:24.817
should be like

00:29:25.820 --> 00:29:26.761
this:

00:29:26.761 --> 00:29:31.570
If there's an intermediate state, there's no reincarnation.

00:29:31.570 --> 00:29:33.930
If you abandon your body and consciousness,

00:29:33.930 --> 00:29:37.270
and there's a gap before you acquire a new body and consciousness, then there

00:29:37.270 --> 00:29:39.210
can't be a cycle.

00:29:39.210 --> 00:29:44.158
It's just a bunch of fragmented pieces,

00:29:44.158 --> 00:29:46.360
not a cycle.

00:29:46.360 --> 00:29:48.780
It doesn't meet the definition of a cycle. A

00:29:48.780 --> 00:29:50.521
cycle should be like this: the same

00:29:50.521 --> 00:29:51.779
thing repeats itself, like

00:29:51.779 --> 00:29:55.170
technical equipment malfunctioning—it

00:29:55.170 --> 00:29:58.800
keeps happening.

00:29:58.800 --> 00:30:00.990
Sorry, I'm not saying this is real, just saying. By the way,

00:30:00.990 --> 00:30:02.600
I'm very grateful to the technical team.

00:30:02.600 --> 00:30:05.571
May God bless them. Now that

00:30:07.560 --> 00:30:11.943
we've finished the second sentence, let's move on to the next one. Yes,

00:30:17.480 --> 00:30:19.933
this is a very interesting continuation.

00:30:21.650 --> 00:30:26.020
Sometimes Nagarjuna will move on to the next topic,

00:30:26.020 --> 00:30:28.950
indicating that he thinks he's closed the case,

00:30:28.950 --> 00:30:32.340
but we (stunned)...
He'll say, "You understand?

00:30:32.340 --> 00:30:33.575
You understand, it means

00:30:33.575 --> 00:30:37.490
no one has acquired any body and consciousness,

00:30:37.490 --> 00:30:39.430
and the body and consciousness haven't been used by anyone.

00:30:39.430 --> 00:30:40.910
Okay, let's move on to the next one."

00:30:40.910 --> 00:30:43.167
Then you say, "Hey, wait a minute..."

00:30:44.590 --> 00:30:46.315
Then we move on to the next sentence.

00:30:46.315 --> 00:30:49.446
He's going to delve into another major topic:

00:30:49.446 --> 00:30:51.729
'DU BYED MYA NGAN 'DA' BAR NI,

00:30:51.729 --> 00:30:54.296
JI LTA BUR YANG MI 'THAD DO,

00:30:54.296 --> 00:30:56.378
SEMS CAN MYA NGAN 'DA' BAR YANG,

00:30:56.378 --> 00:30:58.745
JI LTA BUR YANG 'THAD MI 'GYUR,' We won't

00:30:58.745 --> 00:31:01.280
talk about who

00:31:01.280 --> 00:31:03.810
acquires the body and consciousness anymore. Let's

00:31:03.810 --> 00:31:08.070
talk about who attains Nirvana,

00:31:08.070 --> 00:31:10.070
who breaks through this cycle?

00:31:10.070 --> 00:31:12.920
What happened after that?

00:31:12.920 --> 00:31:15.220
What happens after you break out of the cycle?

00:31:15.220 --> 00:31:18.680
We've discussed cycles, but I don't understand.

00:31:18.680 --> 00:31:21.450
You can neither attain body and consciousness

00:31:21.450 --> 00:31:23.620
nor not attain body and consciousness.

00:31:23.620 --> 00:31:25.898
Something's not right.

00:31:26.760 --> 00:31:29.860
Enough, let's move on to something else.
Who attained enlightenment?

00:31:29.860 --> 00:31:31.751
Who attained Nirvana?  What does

00:31:31.751 --> 00:31:33.870
'DU BYED MYA NGAN 'DA' BAR NI

00:31:33.870 --> 00:31:36.190
'DU BYED' mean in this chapter?  The

00:31:36.190 --> 00:31:37.343
$100 question:

00:31:39.460 --> 00:31:40.493


00:31:41.520 --> 00:31:44.437
What is its significance in this chapter?

00:31:46.350 --> 00:31:48.108
Cancel the bet...

00:31:48.108 --> 00:31:50.410
PHUNG PO—Body and Consciousness. The

00:31:50.410 --> 00:31:53.730
word "karma" in this chapter

00:31:53.730 --> 00:31:55.270
refers to your body and consciousness, which are

00:31:55.270 --> 00:31:59.160
things that change.
Rebecca's changing part:

00:31:59.160 --> 00:32:02.803
As a soul, Rebecca is stainless steel

00:32:03.690 --> 00:32:08.690
, an unchanging egg shape, while Rebecca's body and consciousness,

00:32:10.340 --> 00:32:13.020
he calls them the changing part of Rebecca, that is, the thing

00:32:13.020 --> 00:32:15.036
you acquire and discard in every lifetime.

00:32:15.036 --> 00:32:15.920


00:32:15.920 --> 00:32:19.150
So he says,

00:32:19.150 --> 00:32:24.150
does Rebecca's body and consciousness go to Nirvana?

00:32:24.440 --> 00:32:27.900
Which part of Rebecca went to Nirvana?  Is

00:32:27.900 --> 00:32:30.302
it Rebecca's body and consciousness?

00:32:30.302 --> 00:32:34.490
JI LTA BUR YANG MI 'THAD DO

00:32:36.891 --> 00:32:38.723
This is the frustrating part of reading Nagarjuna.

00:32:38.723 --> 00:32:40.140


00:32:40.140 --> 00:32:43.180
He says no, not Rebecca's body and consciousness

00:32:43.180 --> 00:32:44.290
went to Nirvana.

00:32:44.290 --> 00:32:45.123
Why?

00:32:45.123 --> 00:32:48.176
Because it exists in itself, please,

00:32:50.303 --> 00:32:53.228
not her body and consciousness,

00:32:53.228 --> 00:32:55.720
because the body and consciousness can disappear or something like that.

00:32:55.720 --> 00:32:58.240
Why?
Because it exists in itself.

00:32:58.240 --> 00:33:00.850
It doesn't depend on anything else.

00:33:00.850 --> 00:33:02.930
It doesn't depend on the seed of consciousness. It comes from itself and

00:33:02.930 --> 00:33:06.713
never disappears. It

00:33:08.210 --> 00:33:10.580
illogically comes from itself and

00:33:10.580 --> 00:33:13.580
will illogically maintain its origin from itself.

00:33:13.580 --> 00:33:18.090
And nothing illogical will make it disappear.

00:33:18.090 --> 00:33:22.982
It's an illogical, unchanging, metallic egg shape

00:33:22.982 --> 00:33:24.790
called Rebecca.

00:33:24.790 --> 00:33:26.190
So, forget it.

00:33:26.190 --> 00:33:28.670
Nagarjuna is a bit frustrating, like this.

00:33:28.670 --> 00:33:30.870
This book is a bit frustrating.

00:33:30.870 --> 00:33:32.560
Every time he peeks into a corner, he says, "

00:33:32.560 --> 00:33:35.290
Well, it's impossible anyway."

00:33:35.290 --> 00:33:36.123
Then you ask why, and

00:33:36.123 --> 00:33:38.100
he'll say it's because you think...

00:33:38.100 --> 00:33:39.800
You think your husband in the kitchen

00:33:39.800 --> 00:33:42.992
comes from himself.

00:33:44.430 --> 00:33:46.233
You'll think, "Dude, don't be like that..."

00:33:47.300 --> 00:33:50.600
If your husband in the kitchen is unhappy

00:33:50.600 --> 00:33:54.040
because of traffic at work,

00:33:54.040 --> 00:33:54.873
then your...

00:33:57.840 --> 00:34:01.130
Then your body and consciousness cannot go to Nirvana.

00:34:01.130 --> 00:34:02.150
That's his argument.

00:34:02.150 --> 00:34:05.460
If your husband comes from himself,

00:34:05.460 --> 00:34:09.560
then your body and consciousness cannot be something that goes to Nirvana.

00:34:09.560 --> 00:34:10.393
Why?

00:34:10.393 --> 00:34:13.240
Because the existence of the body and consciousness also comes from itself,

00:34:13.240 --> 00:34:14.940
it cannot be changed. It

00:34:14.940 --> 00:34:18.240
cannot reach a sublime state called Nirvana

00:34:18.240 --> 00:34:19.870
because it cannot be changed

00:34:19.870 --> 00:34:21.690
because it comes from itself. The

00:34:21.690 --> 00:34:23.930
only way to change anything in the universe

00:34:23.930 --> 00:34:27.323
is through the seeds of your consciousness. Do you understand?

00:34:28.340 --> 00:34:31.570
Then that person changed their tune.

00:34:31.570 --> 00:34:34.190
Oh, no, Rebecca's body and consciousness went to Nirvana.

00:34:34.190 --> 00:34:37.746
It's... what's the other option?	  It

00:34:38.580 --> 00:34:40.623
's not Rebecca's body and consciousness,

00:34:41.456 --> 00:34:45.040
but Rebecca.
He calls her GANG ZAG, PARUSHA. Oh

00:34:45.040 --> 00:34:47.010
no, I've changed my mind.

00:34:47.010 --> 00:34:50.900
It's not Rebecca's body and consciousness that go to Nirvana,

00:34:50.900 --> 00:34:53.949
but "Rebecca."

00:34:53.949 --> 00:34:55.282
MYA NGAN 'DA' YANG

00:34:55.282 --> 00:34:58.385
JI LTA BUR YANG 'THAD MI 'GYUR.

00:34:58.385 --> 00:34:59.860
Same question, please.

00:34:59.860 --> 00:35:02.210
Rebecca comes from herself.

00:35:02.210 --> 00:35:05.255
She can't change, she can't go to Nirvana. It's a

00:35:06.180 --> 00:35:08.840
bit like trying to use what
he's trying to prove in his argument

00:35:08.840 --> 00:35:11.180
to prove what he's trying to prove.

00:35:11.180 --> 00:35:13.810
This seems a bit off, but if it really is off,

00:35:13.810 --> 00:35:16.769
then it proves he's right.

00:35:18.420 --> 00:35:20.781
Everything is off. Yes, the

00:35:21.710 --> 00:35:24.463
image here is a bit fake,

00:35:25.530 --> 00:35:28.130
but it's just to help you remember.

00:35:28.130 --> 00:35:33.053
This is Rebecca's body and consciousness. It

00:35:34.408 --> 00:35:36.677
should be consciousness and body.

00:35:36.677 --> 00:35:38.347
Which one goes to Nirvana?

00:35:38.347 --> 00:35:40.068
I didn't know that Lama

00:35:43.310 --> 00:35:48.280
Chöni had a particularly convincing—

00:35:51.025 --> 00:35:54.200
sorry... a particularly convincing—argument here.

00:35:54.200 --> 00:35:56.120
I'd like to read it.

00:35:56.120 --> 00:35:59.880
Sometimes it's good to listen to Lama Chöni's teachings.

00:35:59.880 --> 00:36:02.917
We were just listening to Nagarjuna talk about

00:36:02.917 --> 00:36:06.333
'DIR 'KHOR MKHAN RANG
BZHIN GYIS MED PAR NGES NA'.

00:36:06.333 --> 00:36:09.720
If 'KHOR MKHAN is really... then

00:36:10.697 --> 00:36:13.580
MKHAN is...

00:36:15.350 --> 00:36:20.350
MKHAN is added to a verb to make it the doer.

00:36:20.700 --> 00:36:23.728
For example, teacher is SLOB MKHAN.

00:36:23.728 --> 00:36:26.560
MKHAN is the -er in English (teach-er).

00:36:26.560 --> 00:36:30.000
Adding -er after teach makes it the person who teaches.

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:31.930
In Tibetan, it's MKHAN.

00:36:31.930 --> 00:36:34.408
So what is 'KHOR MKHAN'?

00:36:35.241 --> 00:36:36.074
Yes, the

00:36:36.074 --> 00:36:38.810
one who goes around in circles in the cycle of rebirth,

00:36:38.810 --> 00:36:42.770
'KHOR MKHAN RANG BZHIN
GYIS MED PAR NGES NA', as Lama

00:36:42.770 --> 00:36:45.733
Qiuni said: "Why do we talk about this?

00:36:46.960 --> 00:36:50.130
Why are we so obsessed with this person...

00:36:50.130 --> 00:36:52.970
obsessed with finding out who is

00:36:52.970 --> 00:36:54.537
experiencing reincarnation?"

00:36:56.030 --> 00:36:58.013
Because if

00:36:58.013 --> 00:37:02.672
you can find out that he is

00:37:02.672 --> 00:37:06.317
RANG BZHIN GYIS MED PA,

00:37:07.800 --> 00:37:11.510
yes, if you can find out that the one

00:37:11.510 --> 00:37:14.970
going around in the cycle of rebirth does not come from himself,

00:37:14.970 --> 00:37:19.696
then you can stop going around in the cycle of rebirth!  Do you

00:37:19.696 --> 00:37:21.800
understand?  This is wonderful. Let

00:37:21.800 --> 00:37:23.580
me repeat it again. Lama

00:37:23.580 --> 00:37:25.660
Qiuni said, "Do you want to guess

00:37:25.660 --> 00:37:27.840
why we are so obsessed with

00:37:27.840 --> 00:37:29.620
finding out who is cycling through samsara?"

00:37:29.620 --> 00:37:31.460
We said, "We don't know."

00:37:31.460 --> 00:37:32.830
He said, "Because we want to see

00:37:32.830 --> 00:37:34.700
that person actually has no self-nature."

00:37:34.700 --> 00:37:35.830
Why is that?

00:37:35.830 --> 00:37:39.372
Because that way you won't have to go through the cycle of reincarnation anymore!

00:37:39.372 --> 00:37:41.430
It's a very beautiful argument,

00:37:41.430 --> 00:37:42.263
you know?

00:37:44.130 --> 00:37:47.630
That's why we've had such a long discussion

00:37:47.630 --> 00:37:50.370
about who's going around in the cycle of rebirth.

00:37:50.370 --> 00:37:52.910
Because by examining the relationship between you, your body, and your consciousness,

00:37:52.910 --> 00:37:56.550
you suddenly realize that

00:37:56.550 --> 00:38:00.080
you come from yourself, from your seeds,

00:38:00.080 --> 00:38:03.720
and then you don't have to keep going around in the cycle of rebirth anymore. Yeah,

00:38:05.220 --> 00:38:07.465
that's very much like Lama Chöni.

00:38:07.465 --> 00:38:09.431
Okay, next sentence.

00:38:11.540 --> 00:38:15.382
Now the concept he wants to talk about is

00:38:15.382 --> 00:38:16.597
'CHING BA' and 'GROL BA'.

00:38:16.597 --> 00:38:18.590
I want to jump to the Sanskrit lesson,

00:38:18.590 --> 00:38:21.330
which is the next slide.

00:38:21.330 --> 00:38:24.080
I mainly did this for Christina

00:38:24.080 --> 00:38:26.160
because she likes it.

00:38:26.160 --> 00:38:28.620
We're going to discuss
'CHING BA' and 'GROL BA'.

00:38:28.620 --> 00:38:33.620
This chapter is called "Binding and Liberation"

00:38:33.800 --> 00:38:37.610
or "Handcuffs and Freedom" or something like that.

00:38:37.610 --> 00:38:40.660
We've been discussing who's handcuffed?

00:38:40.660 --> 00:38:43.090
Who is handcuffed?

00:38:43.090 --> 00:38:45.240
Let's first look at the Sanskrit words used here,

00:38:45.240 --> 00:38:48.390
so that you can

00:38:49.260 --> 00:38:51.610
learn some Sanskrit and

00:38:51.610 --> 00:38:55.070
speak it when you become the Medicine Buddha. The

00:38:55.070 --> 00:38:58.607
first word: BANDHA. BANDHA is

00:38:58.607 --> 00:39:00.450
also used in yoga, right?

00:39:00.450 --> 00:39:02.953
Pao, what is BANDHA?

00:39:04.410 --> 00:39:07.285
Yes, locks, we call them locks.

00:39:09.750 --> 00:39:12.540
Similar to that, GRANTHI is worse.

00:39:12.540 --> 00:39:14.348
GRANTHI is like a knot in the energy channels,

00:39:14.348 --> 00:39:17.010
but BANDHA is deliberate...

00:39:17.010 --> 00:39:20.013
probably here.
I don't understand, I can't do it very well. It's just

00:39:20.013 --> 00:39:24.550
tightening your stomach,
that's the BANDHA lock. The

00:39:24.550 --> 00:39:27.100
technical spelling of BANDHA is the same,

00:39:27.100 --> 00:39:31.770
all are English pronunciations of BANDHA. In

00:39:31.770 --> 00:39:34.056
Tibetan it's 'CHING BA'.

00:39:35.850 --> 00:39:39.440
I learned 'CHING BA' from Tibetan newspapers.

00:39:39.440 --> 00:39:41.947
They kept mentioning 'CHING GROL
DMAG MI', the

00:39:44.130 --> 00:39:46.620
People's Liberation Army of China.

00:39:46.620 --> 00:39:51.160
In Tibetan, the Chinese national army is called 'CHING

00:39:51.160 --> 00:39:56.077
GROL DMAG MI', the
army that liberates handcuffs, the

00:39:58.117 --> 00:40:00.011
People's Liberation Army of China.

00:40:00.011 --> 00:40:02.250
So 'CHING' refers to handcuffs.

00:40:02.250 --> 00:40:04.103
'CHING BA

00:40:06.720 --> 00:40:10.847
's root is √BANDH,
meaning to tie up.

00:40:10.847 --> 00:40:15.513
Teacher Jimei, have you ever been to a bus station in India?

00:40:15.513 --> 00:40:18.533
Everyone is on strike, and they will keep shouting:

00:40:18.533 --> 00:40:21.624
BANDH KARO

00:40:21.624 --> 00:40:23.869
We are on strike, we are on strike.

00:40:23.869 --> 00:40:28.053
BANDH means they have tied up all the buses, so they can't
go anywhere.

00:40:29.271 --> 00:40:32.600
Indo-European word is √BHENDH, which
evolved into

00:40:32.600 --> 00:40:35.163
bind, band, and bundle.

00:40:36.030 --> 00:40:38.870
Therefore, it is easy to see that BANDHA means being

00:40:38.870 --> 00:40:41.910
tied to the cycle of reincarnation.

00:40:41.910 --> 00:40:43.442
What is the opposite?  The

00:40:43.442 --> 00:40:46.063
next one is MUKTI or MOKSHA.

00:40:47.760 --> 00:40:52.760
SHA is a retroflex sound; you need to curl your

00:40:53.010 --> 00:40:55.610
tongue back.
MOKSHA MOKSHA in

00:40:56.818 --> 00:40:59.485
Tibetan is GROL BA,
like SGROL MA, Tara (Tara).

00:41:01.440 --> 00:41:05.230
The root is √muc or √mokṣ,
meaning liberation.

00:41:05.230 --> 00:41:08.928
I think the Indo-European word

00:41:11.547 --> 00:41:15.713
MUC means slippery,

00:41:16.550 --> 00:41:18.870
like the viscous fluid mucus, which comes from it.

00:41:18.870 --> 00:41:21.730
I think it refers to sliding out of samsara,

00:41:21.730 --> 00:41:24.775
but I didn't include it here because it's a bit too much.

00:41:26.730 --> 00:41:31.130
In your... I

00:41:31.130 --> 00:41:32.880
think it's all related to the Indo-European word

00:41:32.880 --> 00:41:36.410
√mittere. You

00:41:36.410 --> 00:41:38.520
can also find it in Latin, meaning to

00:41:38.520 --> 00:41:43.520
send a message or
mission. It means to

00:41:43.520 --> 00:41:47.210
liberate someone, understand?

00:41:47.210 --> 00:41:49.540
Now let's return to the text,

00:41:49.540 --> 00:41:52.446
and the slides should go back to

00:41:52.446 --> 00:41:54.512
SKYE 'JIG CHOS CAN 'DU BYED RNAMS,

00:41:54.512 --> 00:41:56.721
MI 'CHING GROL BAR MI 'GYUR TE.

00:41:56.721 --> 00:41:58.850
Don't forget that 'DU BYED' here

00:41:58.850 --> 00:42:01.430
refers to body and consciousness, and the

00:42:01.430 --> 00:42:05.220
spelling is slightly different.

00:42:05.220 --> 00:42:08.177
How do you remove the handcuffs from a SKYE 'JIG

00:42:10.642 --> 00:42:13.730
?  How do you free a person from someone who is

00:42:13.730 --> 00:42:16.844
sometimes present and sometimes absent,

00:42:16.844 --> 00:42:19.780
every single second?

00:42:19.780 --> 00:42:24.017


00:42:25.530 --> 00:42:29.490
How do you remove the handcuffs from someone who is unchanging

00:42:29.490 --> 00:42:31.690
or someone who changes every thousandth of a second

00:42:31.690 --> 00:42:34.165
?

00:42:34.165 --> 00:42:37.020
The moment you put your hand on his handcuffs,

00:42:37.020 --> 00:42:39.280
he becomes a different person.

00:42:39.280 --> 00:42:42.080
How...who is there?

00:42:42.080 --> 00:42:47.080
Who has a permanent body and consciousness that can stay there

00:42:47.610 --> 00:42:50.050
so you can remove his handcuffs?

00:42:50.050 --> 00:42:52.220
Because if he is eternal,

00:42:52.220 --> 00:42:55.660
it means he is unchanging, and that's impossible.

00:42:55.660 --> 00:42:59.220
You can't remove the handcuffs from an eternally existing person

00:42:59.220 --> 00:43:03.000
because he can't change.

00:43:03.000 --> 00:43:05.680
So he can't go from having handcuffs to not having handcuffs

00:43:05.680 --> 00:43:07.840
because he can't change.

00:43:07.840 --> 00:43:11.220
You can't remove the handcuffs from an unchanging person

00:43:11.220 --> 00:43:14.940
because removing the handcuffs is equivalent to changing him, understand?

